    "@question with nothing after it lists your last %@ questions; pick one to see its answer again at once (offline), ⌘R asks it again. Questions and answers stay on this Mac (unless you sync them through iCloud, below); nothing is kept during secure input or for questions on selected text. Turning it off deletes them." : {
      "comment" : "@question 后面不打字就列出最近 %@ 个问题，选一个马上看到当时的答案（不联网），按 ⌘R 重新问。问题和答案只存在这台 Mac 上（除非在下面选了通过 iCloud 同步）；安全输入时和对选中文字的提问不存。关掉会删掉已存的。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/SettingsWindow.swift"
    },
    "@question with nothing after it lists your last %@ questions; pick one to see its answer again at once (offline), ⌘R asks it again. Questions and answers stay on this Mac; nothing is kept during secure input or for questions on selected text. Turning it off deletes them." : {
      "comment" : "@question 后面不打字就列出最近 %@ 个问题，选一个马上看到当时的答案（不联网），按 ⌘R 重新问。问题和答案只存在这台 Mac 上；安全输入时和对选中文字的提问不存。关掉会删掉已存的。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/SettingsWindow.swift",
      "extractionState" : "stale"
    },
    "@question's questions and answers; only while “Remember recent questions” is on. Turned off, the ones synced stay in iCloud until you remove them." : {
      "comment" : "@question 的问题和答案；只在开了「记住最近的问题」时同步。关掉后已同步的仍留在 iCloud 里，用「从 iCloud 移除…」删掉。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/ICloudSyncSettings.swift"
    },
    "@search searches the web with Brave Search, using your own API key: Brave gives some free credit each month (about 1,000 searches for now); signing up needs a credit card. What you search for is sent to Brave. The key is kept in the keychain; you can also set BRAVE_API_KEY in your shell." : {
      "comment" : "@search 用 Brave Search 搜网页，用你自己的 API key：Brave 每月送一些免费额度（目前约 1000 次搜索），注册时要绑信用卡。要搜的内容会发给 Brave。key 存在钥匙串里；也可以在 shell 里设置 BRAVE_API_KEY。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/SettingsWindow.swift"
